<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				     Week to June 6    Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		   7,520.96	   159,139.74</p>
<p>    - sales			 7,442.89	   147,626.64</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)	78.06	    11,513.10</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
